        "strongest_baseline_accuracy": 0.904,
        "baseline_count": 10
      },
      "comparison_caveats": [
        "The published protocol is a reproduction target, not an aircraft SHM result.",
        "Stratified window-level folds are not evidence of generalization to a held-out acquisition period, specimen, configuration, environment or sensor installation.",
        "The 0.5 Hz high-pass and per-channel z-score preprocessing may suppress low-frequency drift and channel gain signatures; evaluate the published pipeline as-is for fair replication, then separately evaluate fault-preserving preprocessing.",
        "The paper's 27 reported channels differ from KU Leuven's official long-term overview count of 16 acceleration measurements. These may represent different channel subsets/acquisition configurations; reconcile against exact registered files before claiming reproduction.",
        "The reported 92.2% is classification accuracy, not fault-isolation precision, damage POD, false-clear probability, decision preservation or aircraft safety."
      ],
      "admission": {
        "status": "PUBLISHED_PROTOCOL_REFERENCE_ONLY",
        "source_bytes_retrieved": false,
